## Official DeepSeek Harness packages

`dsh-mcp-guard` is built on official DeepSeek Harness extension points and uses
the official MCP client from the running host as an optional peer dependency:

- `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` — official MCP client bridge, license MIT,
  <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness> (`packages/mcp/mcp-client`).
  Connections, process spawning, reconnection, tool discovery and
  `mcp__<server>__<tool>` naming are owned by this package.
- Other `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` packages are used at runtime by the host and are not
  vendored, copied or redistributed in this repository.

"DeepSeek", "DeepSeek Harness" and "DSH" are names/trademarks of their respective
owners and are used here only to describe compatibility.

